<h1 style="text-align: start; line-height: 1.1; font-weight: bold; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 26px; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="start">GovDelivery SMS Migration Upgrade</h1>
<h2 style="text-align: start; line-height: 1.1; font-weight: bold; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #d3222a; font-size: 18px; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="start">For GovDelivery Administrators</h2>
<p class="gd_p" style="text-align: start; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="start">Greetings!</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">Over the past year, Granicus/GovDelivery has invested in modernizing its sending stack to facilitate a more scalable SMS performance. Since completing migrations with several of its largest volume senders, they are now ready to migrate all its customers to this new infrastructure.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">This refinement will also facilitate accelerated GovDelivery feature adoption in 2025 and beyond.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">To facilitate this migration, GovDelivery has planned migration for the City of Columbus on <strong>March 18, 4 pm – 6 pm ET</strong>.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">During this time, GovDelivery will experience a period of downtime.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">Please check your scheduled or planned bulletin dates and times.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">If this time interferes with your SMS communications strategy, please let us know as soon as possible in case we may need to communicate with Granicus/GovDelivery about selecting an alternative migration date.</p>
<p class="gd_p" style="text-align: start; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="start">If you have any questions or concerns, please send an e-mail to the Web Admin Team group <a href="mailto:webadmin@columbus.gov" target="_blank" title="DoT Web Admin Team Inbox" rel="noopener" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">inbox</a>.</p>
<p class="gd_p" style="text-align: start; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="start"> </p>
